v class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-topbar_knKqX"><button data-popover-id="R28L6PLQ4TWPQD" class="_Y3Itd_close-button_2RG2d" data-hook="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButton" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButtonClickHandler" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-id="uatj34-7396h7-whpse2-jfushq"><i class="a-icon a-icon-close-white a-icon-medium" role="presentation"></i></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-view-container_1kFg1" data-hook="ReviewMediaList"><button data-popover-id="R28L6PLQ4TWPQD" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-overlay_2x3M5" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverNextMediaClickHandler"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><div data-hook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R1KHSGS542EIO6" data-asin="054792819X" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-US" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="false" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="R1KHSGS542EIO6" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R1KHSGS542EIO6" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="mtf195-tl1de9-yf5xpm-vgm8nd"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGPO7XWZW4TRITUFT25TWNHZH23A?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R1KHSGS542EIO6_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="qw4eek-w83rug-qqfpoe-dbo6rp"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/81414cb7-644b-4608-8e4b-239fe57118e9._CR83%2C0%2C333%2C333_SX460_SX48_.jpg" class="" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/81414cb7-644b-4608-8e4b-239fe57118e9._CR83%2C0%2C333%2C333_SX460_SX48_.jpg"></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Jason Galbraith</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-4"><span class="a-icon-alt">4 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1KHSGS542EIO6/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US"> The Only Easy Day Was Yesterday </h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary"> Reviewed in the United States on June 6, 2020 </span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="/portal/customer-reviews/054792819X/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary"> Format: Paperback </span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold"> Verified Purchase </span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-10"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-10-teaser-describedby-collapsed"> Brief content visible, double tap to read full content. </div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-10-teaser-describedby-expanded"> Full content visible, double tap to read brief content. </div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-10-card0" data-csa-c-id="mv3xgd-8ob28a-7qdzk-b7ky2c"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span> I used the above motto of the US Navy SEALs as the bottom line in my review of the film version of "Return of the King" seventeen years ago. That is because the hobbits in this book are essentially Special Forces. While Pippin and Merry embed with indigenous forces and play crucial parts in their victory over Dark Lord Sauron, Sam and Frodo go behind enemy lines to destroy the artifact from which derives all his power, the One Ring. </span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span> The book doesn't necessarily stand out among books the way "Return of the King" stands out among movies, but any flaws in Book Five, covering Pippin, Merry and the forces they are embedded with, are redeemed by Book Six, the first three chapters in which cover Sam and Frodo's heroic journey to cast the Ring into the lava that continually pours forth from Mount Doom. The rest of Book Six covers Aragorn's crowning and marriage, the return of the hobbits to the Shire, the scourging of the Shire (it's true this should not have been left out of the movie) and the Ringbearers' final leave-taking from Middle Earth. </span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span> As I read Tolkien's descriptions of the lands through which the hobbits move, I was reminded of Robert Silverberg's Majipoor series. Silverberg was only one of the many writers of the following generation who were obviously deeply influenced by Tolkien. The narrative part of "Return of the King" is a short 278 pages. The appendices (which I did not read) cover an additional 104 pages. </span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span> When I came out with a qualified declaration of my Christianity on Facebook last month, I named three theologians who had influenced me to do so. An ex-girlfriend asked me why Tolkien was not among these three. Now that I have read "Return of the King," I venture to guess is it more influenced by Norse sagas than by the Book of Revelations which some evangelicals would like to think he was really writing about. This of course is not to say that Tolkien's Christianity was unimportant to his writing, only that he was not saying what some twenty-first-century Americans might wish he was saying. Four stars. </span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="4bspmi-c5mopg-1b6df8-5ztygd"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text"> Read more </span><span class="a-see-less-text"> Read less </span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary"> 3 people found this helpful </span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="054792819X" data-id="R1KHSGS542EIO6" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R1KHSGS542EIO6_helpful_button" data-csa-c-id="r4mp0x-fyqenh-9t0atw-1bvd9b"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-47"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-47-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-47-announce"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-text-desktop_2dXQG"> Helpful </div></span></span></span></div><span data-hook="helpfulVoteLoadingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD"> Sending feedback... </span><div data-hook="helpfulVoteSuccessMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success _Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD a-spacing-block" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content"> Thank you for your feedback. </div></div></div><div data-hook="helpfulVoteErrorMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-error _Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD a-spacing-block" role="alert"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content"> Sorry, we failed to record your vote. Please try again </div></div></div></div><i aria-hidden="true" class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="img" aria-label="|"></i><div data-hook="reportAbuseButton" data-mix-operations="ReportAbuseClickHandler" data-asin="054792819X" data-id="R1KHSGS542EIO6" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-